#: kram/app/actions.py:94
msgid "Export List as CSV…"
msgstr "목록을 CSV로 내보내기…"

#: kram/app/actions.py:95
msgid "Save the packages listed now, in their order, to a CSV file"
msgstr "지금 목록에 표시된 패키지를 그 순서대로 CSV 파일에 저장합니다"

#: kram/app/actions.py:96
msgid "Transaction History…"
msgstr "트랜잭션 기록…"

#: kram/app/actions.py:97
msgid "What dnf installed, upgraded and removed, and when; undo a transaction"
msgstr "dnf가 언제 무엇을 설치, 업그레이드, 제거했는지; 트랜잭션 되돌리기"

